{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549730/extras/5bdcb8ef4a2b0031a457869737efce2a.avif?t=1774095001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549730/extras_big/5bdcb8ef4a2b0031a457869737efce2a.avif?t=1774095001 width=800 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong>: Take down swarms of aliens with quick reflexes and calculated precision. Chain kills into streaks to earn extra points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Fully voiced 3D cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: A symphonic score for the intro and ending, and aggresive synths in-gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two endings</strong>: Earn 20,000 points or more (or complete the game in Ace difficulty) and unlock the secret ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong>: Diverse alien species, each with unique flight patterns, attacks, and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong>: Test your mettle against powerful alien bosses that demand your best dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong>:\u00a0Three modes that adapt the challenge for every player, from story focused to pure suffering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun achievements</strong>: Unlock them by exploiting enemy mechanics.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All To Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549730/da3df22efb9b37a88000c2923cef1c7cc6f2ee98.jpg"},{"name":"Rediscovered Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549730/db09773c1ab4a670d8a89ac5bee0ce0482f03fe8.jpg"},{"n